# Topic 12 — Modifying Worksheet

## Objective

Learn how to modify and manage an Excel worksheet while preserving the original dataset.

## Skills Practiced

- Copying data
- Inserting rows
- Inserting columns
- Deleting rows
- Deleting columns
- Moving columns
- Renaming worksheets
- Copying worksheets
- Hiding and unhiding columns
- Adjusting row height
- Adjusting column width
- Find and Replace

## Dataset

A Pinterest product dataset was used to practice worksheet modification.

## Original vs Modified Data

The `Original_Data` sheet was kept unchanged.

A separate `Modified_Product_Data` sheet was used for practicing worksheet modifications.

## Key Learning

Keeping an original copy of the data is important before making structural changes.

Excel provides tools to insert, delete, move, hide, copy, and modify worksheet elements without rebuilding the entire dataset.

## File

